# Project Orientation — {{CAMPAIGN_TITLE}}

The campaign's orienting document: the end goal, the decision it drives, the loosely-held expectations
to test, and the numbered task hierarchy, each task tied to how it serves the goal. Read at the start of
a session and revisit at every checkpoint. `frame-problem` graduates its decomposition here;
`campaign-status` re-checks orientation against it. Keep it lean. It steers; it does not narrate. The
logbook narrates.

