## Revisit at checkpoints
At each `campaign-status` checkpoint: is the goal still the right goal? Have expectations shifted on the
evidence? Are tasks still serving it? Re-open a parked direction that a discovery has unblocked. Is
complexity climbing without payoff? That is a pivot signal; see the physkit plugin's `docs/reference/pivoting.md`.
